# --- Auto-generated docs (regen via `make` / scripts — NUNCA commitear) ---
# Cement 2026-05-20 — Chris ratificó "gitignore total" para evitar merge conflicts
# crónicos en archivos derivados. SSoT vive en las sources; estos son views.
#
# Cómo regenerar localmente cuando los necesites:
#   make portfolio          # docs/portfolio/{PORTFOLIO,brand,luana}.md cross-brand
#   make infra-matrix       # docs/portfolio/INFRA-MATRIX.md
#   .venv/bin/python scripts/generate_backlog.py --brand vitalia    # per-brand
#   .venv/bin/python scripts/generate_backlog.py                    # legacy root
#   make scan-promotables   # docs/promotion-protocol/scan-{date}.yaml
#
# Pre-commit hook Sections 6 + 10 siguen regenerando localmente (working tree
# fresh) pero ya NO auto-stage. Ver `.claude/rules/brand-docs-schema.md` R3.

# Per-brand BACKLOG (10 brands: 4 active + 6 future templates)
*/docs/product/BACKLOG.md
*/docs/product/BACKLOG.yaml
*/docs/product/BACKLOG-TLDR.md

# Legacy single-brand BACKLOG (pre-multibrand reorg, todavia generado)
docs/product/BACKLOG.md
docs/product/BACKLOG.yaml
docs/product/BACKLOG-TLDR.md

# Cross-brand portfolio (vistas auto-gen master + per-brand + INFRA-MATRIX)
